OL,3,GNEWSAUK inflation hits highest rate in
OL,4,Aa year, driven by rising fuel prices
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe UK inflation rate rose again in
OL,7,FOctober, hitting 3.6%
OL,9,FIt's the fourth consecutive monthly
OL,10,Frise, and the highest rate in a year -
OL,11,Fthe Bank of England's target is 2%
OL,13,FThe Office for National Statistics says
OL,14,Fhigher fuel bills were "once again a
OL,15,Fmajor contributor"
OL,17,FThe government says wars in the Middle
OL,18,FEast and Ukraine have "pushed up costs
OL,19,Faround the world"
OL,23,APub: 18-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
