OL,3,GNEWSAUK inflation hits highest rate in
OL,4,Aa year, driven by rising fuel prices
OL,5,
OL,6,FBut the shadow chancellor says the
OL,7,Fgovernment's decision to "hike taxes
OL,8,Fand employment costs" have contributed
OL,9,Fto the inflation increase
OL,11,FMost economists expected a rise in
OL,12,FOctober - and more increases are
OL,13,Fexpected
OL,15,FEarlier this month, the Bank raised
OL,16,Finterest rates to 4% - the first
OL,17,Fincrease since 2023 - in an effort to
OL,18,Fcurb inflation
